.# Test that a column gets the alignment of the cells specifying one, ignoring the cells without alignment (first
.# column: header cell only, second column: body cell only), and gets no alignment when they disagree (third column)
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|=(% align="center" %)h1|=h2|=(% align="left" %)h3
|a|(% align="right" %)b|(% align="right" %)c
